id: pm-0ctouz
title: Measure and reduce registry rebuilding during dependency batch mutations
description: The corrected create/update dependency parser resolves the active relationship registry during per-entry normalization and again during kind admission. A large batch therefore repeatedly rebuilds the same registered ontology and payload schema snapshots. Measure this cost and reuse a coherent registry snapshot per parse or mutation scope while retaining legacy diagnostics and extension isolation.
